Natalie,
 Attached is the Letter Agreement for Brightmoor LLC. According
to Ilse, St. Mila's production is being delivered at the same points as is
the Hunt Southern Louisiana production. Therefore, the St. Mila's letter is
identical to the Hunt letter which Ilse is sending to Hunt today. If this
is not the case, please let me know and I will modify to fit the terms of the
St. Mila's deal. Otherwise, please print off as many originals as you need
and send them to St. Mila's for their execution and return. Please call if
you have any questions.

Helena

